:''This article is about the Cat Unit. For the enemy, see [[Hyper Mr. (Enemy)]].''
'''Mr.''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that was added in [[Version 1.0 Update|Version 1.0]] and can be purchased for 160 [[Cat Food]] in the [[Upgrade Menu]] after completing [[India (Empire of Cats)|India]] in [[Empire of Cats]] Chapter 2. In [[Version 3.3 Update|Version 3.3]], [[True Form]] grants the [[Zombie Killer]] ability and increases movement speed. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 10.0 Update|Version 10.0]]. In [[The Battle Cats POP!]], he is unlocked from clearing [[Vega (Cats of the Cosmos)|Vega]] in Chapter 3 and costs 22,000 XP. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], he is unlocked from clearing [[United Kingdom (Into the Future)|United Kingdom]] in the [[Into the Future]] chapter and costs 80 Cat Food.

