==Trivia==
*[[Version 1.0 Update#Version 1.0.2 Update|Version 1.0.2]] increased Mr.'s recharge from 2 seconds to 7.2 seconds.
*Prior to [[Version 4.7 Update|Version 4.7]], Mr. was a part of another [[Cat Combo]] called [[Triggermen (Removed Combo)|Triggermen]].
*Mr. was given the [[Zombie Killer]] ability in [[Version 5.6 Update|Version 5.6]].
*He is the first Cat Unit introduced to not have a Cat face or even a face at all in any of his Forms.
*The gun Mr. carries in his Normal Form is an [[wikipedia:M16 rifle|M16]].
*Mr. is the main protagonist of the "Mr." series of apps made by [[PONOS Corporation|PONOS]].
**Despite this, he is not officially considered a [[:Category:Collaboration Event Cats|collab unit]].
*In the Nintendo Switch port, since Hyper Mr. goes completely unused in this version, it was not granted the Zombie Killer ability, making it the only current version where its True Form does not grant such ability.
*Prior to [[Version 15.6 Update|Version 15.6]], Mr.'s descriptions read as follows:
