The series has trained his legs for speed,
and he can shoot down all the enemies. (Area)</pre>
<pre>Super Mr.
Mr. is here from the popular "Mr." series.
The series has trained his legs for speed,
and now he has a bazooka. BAM. (Area)</pre>
<pre>Hyper Mr.
